# ==========================================================================
#  数据红线 —— 本仓库为【公开】仓库
#
#  · MIMIC-IV 受 PhysioNet DUA 约束，明文禁止再分发
#  · 院内 HIS / 自有队列含患者信息，任何形式都不得入库
#  · 策略为「默认拒绝 + 白名单」：只有 data-raw/synthetic/ 下的小体量
#    合成或完全脱敏数据可以被跟踪
#
#  误提交后即使 revert，历史里仍然可取回。宁可漏传，不可误传。
# ==========================================================================
data-raw/*
!data-raw/README.md
!data-raw/synthetic/
data-raw/synthetic/*
!data-raw/synthetic/README.md
!data-raw/synthetic/*.csv
!data-raw/synthetic/*.R

# 双保险：常见数据格式在任何位置都不收
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.dta
*.sav
*.sas7bdat
*.parquet
*.feather
*.rds
*.RData
*.rda

# 压缩包：MIMIC-IV 原生分发就是 .csv.gz，上面的 *.csv 拦不住
*.gz
*.bz2
*.xz
*.zst
*.zip
*.7z

# 例外：包自带数据与合成演示数据
!data/*.rda
!inst/extdata/**
!data-raw/synthetic/*.csv
!data-raw/synthetic/*.R

# --------------------------------------------------------------- R
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.Ruserdata
*.Rcheck/
*.tar.gz
src/*.o
src/*.so
src/*.dll

# --------------------------------------------------------------- renv
renv/library/
renv/local/
renv/cellar/
renv/python/
renv/sandbox/
renv/staging/

# --------------------------------------------------------------- Quarto / knitr
/.quarto/
*_cache/
*_files/

# --------------------------------------------------------------- 输出
output/cache/*
!output/cache/.gitkeep

# --------------------------------------------------------------- 文献 PDF（版权）
learn/refs/pdf/*
!learn/refs/pdf/.gitkeep

# --------------------------------------------------------------- 系统
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

**/*.quarto_ipynb
